==Enemy==
Elder Sloth has significantly higher stats than [[THE SLOTH]] and can be difficult to avoid, with 500 range. Just to top it off, he also has 6x the speed of THE SLOTH and a 100% chance to knockback your units for more annoyingness. He can probably block your path in [[Machu Picchu (Into the Future)|Machu Picchu (Into the Future Ch. 3)]] from getting [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] in [[Into the Future]].

==Strategy==
Despite his knockback ability, the same strategy for the regular SLOTH should work just as well in most cases: tank him with [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cats]] and [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed M. Titan Cats]] with a little bit of meatshielding, while sneaking in units with high DPS like [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]]. Use units such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]], and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to deal massive damage. An alternative strategy is to use long-ranged cats that outrange him like [[Sharpshooter Saki (Uber Rare Cat)|Sharpshooter Saki]], [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Dark Emperor Catdam]], [[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Super Galaxy Cosmo]], [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Aphrodite]], etc. to snipe him.

