==Trivia==
*Elder Sloth's face and body shape are reminiscent of the [[wikia:ghibli:River Spirit|River Spirit]] from the Studio Ghibli film ''[[wikia:ghibli:Spirited Away|Spirited Away]]''. His Japanese name, Yokikana (ヨキカナ), is a reference to "[https://youtu.be/A6ljbiHEJqY yoki kana]" (よきかな, "wonderful" or "excellent"), which is what the River Spirit says instead of "[https://youtu.be/VmvvGW_KPck well done]" in the original Japanese version of ''Spirited Away'', and the hot spring resort mentioned in his description may allude to the [[wikia:ghibli:Bathhouse|Bathhouse]] from the movie.

